# Build artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
# build/ itself is NOT ignored: Task 9 (vis/v1-engine) put hand-written, committed source tooling
# there (build/figure-gen.js, the deterministic chart generator), not generated output. The line
# that used to blanket-ignore it ("none yet, reserved") was reserved for a future dist-style
# artifact directory that never arrived; a real committed script arrived instead, and a gitignore
# rule silently dropping a brief-required source file from every future `git add` is exactly the
# omission ACCEPTANCE-file-lists.md exists to catch. If generated build output ever lands here,
# ignore its specific subpath, not the whole directory.

